  The survival function is defined as

  .. math::

     f_{sf}(x) = 1 - f_{cdf}(x)

  where :math:`f_{cdf}(x)` is the exponential cumulative distribution function,
  :func:`jax.scipy.stats.expon.cdf`.

  Args:
